This project vendors two code-review system prompts, both obtained under
the Apache License, Version 2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0):

- `plugins/agy/agents/agy-review/agent.md`, derived from `openai/codex`'s
  review prompt — captured via a third-party gist mirror, then verified
  2026-07-28 against current upstream at
  `codex-rs/prompts/templates/review/rubric.md` (blob
  85e89cb7eeadb97fa9e4868d2b9977c87225506d). See that file's own PROVENANCE
  note for the diff evidence and the adaptations made.
- `plugins/agy/agents/agy-adversarial-review/agent.md`, ported from
  `openai/codex-plugin-cc`'s own `plugins/codex/prompts/adversarial-review.md`
  and `plugins/codex/commands/adversarial-review.md`, read directly from a
  clone of that repository. Its output schema deliberately differs from
  upstream's own prompt (see that file's PROVENANCE note) to stay compatible
  with the parsing this repo already shares with `agy-review`.

`agy-plugin-cc` is itself a deliberate port of `openai/codex-plugin-cc`
(https://github.com/openai/codex-plugin-cc), distributed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. The Claude-facing surface, the per-repo state dir, the
job model, and the git diff-sizing logic in this repository are adapted from
that project.

